    <!doctype html>
    <html lang="en">
      <head>
        <meta charset="utf-8" />
        <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover" />
        <meta name="theme-color" content="#121d1b" />
        <meta name="description" content="Learn to play Ironroot Frontier in five short practice lessons. Your saved game stays untouched." />
        <title>Guided practice · Ironroot Frontier</title>
        <link rel="icon" href="./icon.svg" type="image/svg+xml" />
        <link rel="stylesheet" href="./training.css" />
      </head>
      <body>
        <header class="training-header">
          <a href="./" id="returnGame" class="return-link" aria-label="Return to game: Ironroot Frontier">← Return to game</a>
          <span class="training-brand">IRONROOT <b>FIELD SCHOOL</b></span>
        </header>
        <p class="safe-notice"><strong>Practice only.</strong> Your saved battle and progress stay untouched. Practice resets when you leave and earns no rewards.</p>
        <main class="training-workspace">
          <section class="field-panel" id="fieldPanel" aria-label="Practice battlefield">
            <div class="field-heading">
              <span id="fieldState">INSTRUCTIONS · TIME STOPPED</span>
              <span><b id="gold">0</b> gold <small id="income">+5/s</small></span>
              <span id="battleTime">0:00</span>
            </div>
            <p id="fieldAction" class="field-action">Follow the current lesson below.</p>
            <div class="canvas-wrap" id="canvasWrap">
              <canvas id="trainingBattle" tabindex="0" aria-label="Practice battlefield. Choose a building, then tap a highlighted site. Drag to pan. You can also use the named site buttons in the lesson panel." aria-describedby="fieldHelp fieldAction"></canvas>
              <span class="map-note" aria-hidden="true">YOUR FRONTIER →</span>
            </div>
            <nav class="map-controls" aria-label="Battlefield navigation">
              <button type="button" id="homeCamera" title="Home camera (H)">⌂ Home</button>
              <canvas id="trainingMinimap" tabindex="0" role="slider" aria-label="Battlefield minimap position" aria-valuemin="0" aria-valuemax="3200" aria-valuenow="700" aria-valuetext="Your frontier"></canvas>
              <button type="button" id="frontCamera" title="Front camera (F)">Front →</button>
            </nav>
            <p id="fieldHelp" class="field-help">Drag to pan · tap minimap to travel · H home · F front · ← → pan</p>
          </section>
          <aside class="coach" aria-label="Guided practice lesson">
            <div class="lesson-switcher">
              <label for="lessonPicker">Replay a lesson</label>
              <select id="lessonPicker"></select>
            </div>
            <div class="lesson-heading"><span id="lessonNumber" class="eyebrow">LESSON 1 / 5</span><span id="stepCount" class="step-count"></span></div>
            <h1 id="lessonName">Guided practice</h1>
            <p id="lessonSubtitle" class="lesson-subtitle"></p>
            <details class="setup-disclosure"><summary id="setupSummary">Practice setup</summary><ul id="setupBriefing"></ul></details>
            <section class="instruction" aria-labelledby="stepTitle">
              <span id="stepKind" class="step-kind">YOUR TURN</span>
              <h2 id="stepTitle" tabindex="-1">Preparing your lesson…</h2>
              <p id="stepPrompt"></p>
              <p id="objective" class="objective"></p>
              <ul id="reviewResults" class="review-results" hidden></ul>
              <div class="status-message" id="feedback" role="status" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true"></div>
              <div class="lesson-actions">
                <button type="button" id="continueLesson" class="primary" hidden>Continue</button>
                <button type="button" id="pauseLesson" hidden>Pause observation</button>
                <button type="button" id="recoverGold" hidden>Wait for income</button>
              </div>
            </section>
            <section class="command-panel" aria-label="Available lesson actions">
              <div class="command-heading"><h2>Build deck</h2><button type="button" id="cancelChoice" class="quiet" disabled>Cancel</button></div>
              <p id="choiceHint" class="choice-hint">Choose a building, then a marked site.</p>
              <div id="buildDeck" class="build-deck"></div>
              <div id="siteActions" class="site-actions" aria-label="Marked practice sites"></div>
              <div id="buildingActions" class="site-actions" aria-label="Your highlighted buildings"></div>
              <div id="selectionPanel" class="selection-panel" hidden>
                <span id="selectionName"></span>
                <button type="button" id="upgradeBuilding">Upgrade</button>
              </div>
            </section>
            <div class="session-actions"><button type="button" id="restartLesson">↻ Restart lesson</button><button type="button" id="skipLesson">Skip lesson →</button></div>
            <details class="controls-help">
              <summary>Controls &amp; practice rules</summary>
              <p>Touch, mouse and keyboard. Choose a build card, then tap the gold highlighted site. Drag more than 8 pixels to pan without spending gold. Select Cancel before choosing a building already on the field.</p>
              <p>1–7 choose the matching available building. Escape cancels. H / F move home / front; arrow keys pan. Space pauses or resumes an observation. Tab moves between controls; Enter or Space activates a focused button. The named site buttons are an alternative to tapping the map.</p>
              <p>Buildings and upgrades cost gold. Each step highlights the actions you can take. Time stops for instructions and runs for observations. Leaving this tab pauses the lesson. Select Resume observation when you return.</p>
              <p>Each lesson has its own starting army and gold. Practice saves no progress, history or rewards and leaves your backups untouched. Replay any lesson. Controllers are not supported here.</p>
            </details>
          </aside>
        </main>
        <noscript><p class="load-error">Practice needs JavaScript. <a href="./">Return to the game.</a></p></noscript>
        <script type="module" src="./training-app.js"></script>
      </body>
    </html>
    
